  <ContentWarnings>Theft, a time paradox that destroys the universe, and a giant bird of prey that carries someone off for dinner. All of it played for laughs.</ContentWarnings>
  <Blurb>You are Amir, the last of the forty thieves, the one who gets all the worst jobs. The chief has left his scimitar in the cave and sends you to fetch it.

You arrive just in time to hear "Close, Sesame!" and to see a man riding off into the desert loaded with riches. It is Ali Baba, and he has taken the road to the Sultan's palace. If he gets there, you are all finished.</Blurb>
