  <Page id="1" sound="vento" soundDelay="4">
    <Text>You are Amir, the last of the forty thieves, the outcast of the band who gets all the worst jobs. After yet another raid, the chief realises he has left his scimitar inside the cave and, so as not to waste time on the raids in the diary, decides to send you to fetch it. You are heading grumpily for the cave when a voice makes you jump: — Close, Sesame! —

What is going on? A man on his dromedary is riding off into the desert loaded with riches: it is Ali Baba, and he has just taken the path that leads to the Sultan's palace. You must stop him before he reveals the hiding place to the royal guards!

Ali Baba has a good head start. It will be hard to catch him.</Text>
