  <Page id="3" sound="ruggito" soundDelay="2">
    <Text>As you pass by, you slip the object away with the ease of the professional you are. Who knows whether the legend is true? You rub the lamp and a Genie comes out of it: — Greetings, master. I am here to… —

— Grant my wishes? —

— No, I only have the power to take you back in time. Call me when you need it. —</Text>
