  <Page id="16" ending="true">
    <Text>Sadly, you did not manage to stop Ali Baba, who reaches the palace and reports what happened. The royal guards are mobilised and, within a few days, you and your companions are caught and thrown into the Sultan's dungeons to rot. Your adventure ends here.</Text>
  </Page>
  <Page id="17" ending="true">
    <Text>You missed the handover of the subscription to your past self, causing a space-time paradox that destroys the universe. If it is any consolation, you can say you stopped Ali Baba, in a manner of speaking.</Text>
  </Page>
  <Page id="18" sound="ruggito" soundDelay="1" ending="true">
    <Text>The moment you sound the call, a gigantic winged shape drops out of the sky and heads for you: it is a Roc, a bird of prey of gargantuan size. It seizes you in its mighty talons and carries you off to its nest.

You have earned a place of honour at tonight's dinner... as the main course.</Text>
  </Page>
  <Page id="19" sound="ruggito" soundDelay="2" ending="true">
    <Text>The moment the call is sounded, a gigantic winged shape heads your way: it is a Roc, a bird of prey of gargantuan size. Drawn by the birdseed, it dives on Ali Baba, who comes to a sticky end.

You have saved your band and you can celebrate with your fellow thieves: congratulations!</Text>
  </Page>
